Model weights and word lists in this directory.

- ch_PP-OCRv5_det_mobile.onnx, ch_PP-LCNet_x0_25_textline_ori_cls_mobile.onnx,
  PP-OCRv6_rec_small.onnx, ppocrv6_dict.txt, latin_PP-OCRv5_rec_mobile.onnx and
