- lexicon-pl.txt.gz: the sjp.pl Polish spell-checking dictionary, https://sjp.pl/sl/en/,
  which its authors license under the Apache-2.0, GPL-2, LGPL-2.1, MPL-1.1 or CC BY 4.0, at
  the user's choice; it is used here under Apache-2.0.
- lexicon-en.txt.gz: SCOWL, Copyright 2000-2011 Kevin Atkinson and the other holders named in
  LICENSE-SCOWL.txt, which carries the full notice.
- Both word lists are modified: lowercased, deduplicated, sorted and gzipped.
- postal-pl.txt.gz: GeoNames postal codes for Poland, https://www.geonames.org/, licensed
  under CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Modified: only codes whose
  place name has one spelling once the Polish marks are removed are kept.
